00:34:24,705 --> 00:34:30,705
Now You See Me: Now You Don't is a 2025 American heist film directed by Ruben Fleischer from a screenplay by Michael Lesslie, the
writing duo of Paul Wernick and Rhett Reese, and Seth Grahame-Smith, based on a story by Eric Warren Singer and Lesslie.

10
00:38:14,117 --> 00:38:20,117
The film is the sequel to  Now You See Me 2 (2016) and the third
installment in the  Now You See Me film series.

11
