previous films, joined by new cast members Justice Smith, Dominic Sessa, Ariana Greenblatt, and Rosamund Pike.

12
00:45:52,941 --> 00:45:58,941
Now You See Me: Now You Don't premiered at the Harbour Club in Amsterdam, Netherlands, on November
11, 2025, and was released in the United States on November 14, 2025, by Lionsgate.

13
00:49:42,352 --> 00:49:48,352
The film grossed $240 million worldwide and received mixed reviews from critics.

